OL,3,GNEWSADecision due on #7m shopping
OL,4,Acentre revamp funding
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #7m funding package to help
OL,7,Fturn a former shopping centre into a
OL,8,Fleisure complex are set to be discussed
OL,9,Fby council leaders.
OL,11,FScarborough Group International wants
OL,12,Fto create a six-screen cinema as well
OL,13,Fas food and drink outlets at Brunswick
OL,14,FShopping Centre, which closed last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire Council previously
OL,18,Fagreed to lend developers #8m, provide
OL,19,F#10.5m in public grant funding and
OL,20,Fallocate a further #3.5m from the
OL,21,Fgovernment's Pride in Place programme.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
